### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanTaxiTrafficWithLaneIntrusion" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow taxi vehicle in left lane" .
:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow taxi vehicle in right lane" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Gray vehicle partially occluded by trees, intruding into central lane" .

:weather1 a :DayCondition ;
    :description "Clear daytime with good visibility" .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Gray vehicle intruding into central lane, risk of collision with following taxis" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision risk due to taxis following too closely behind gray vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .
```

